{
  "adds": ["uPattern", "unifier"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "title": { "zh": "几个变量" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "?P(x, y) 是一句关于 x 和 y 的话。两个「对所有」逐层拆开，等式前记上 ⋀x y；?P 后面跟着两个不同的约束变量，仍是模式。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "r-patterns",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "unify",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "等式" } }],
      "tests": [
        { "eqs": ["∀x. ∀y. ?P(x, y) ≐ ∀x. ∀y. Likes(x, y) ∨ Likes(y, x)"] },
        { "eqs": ["∀x. ?P(x) ∧ ?Q(x) ≐ ∀y. Human(y) ∧ Likes(y, i)"] },
        { "eqs": ["∀x. ∀y. ?P(y, x) ≐ ∀x. ∀y. Likes(x, y)"] },
        { "eqs": ["∀x. ?P(x) ∧ ?A ≐ ∀y. Likes(y, i) ∧ Likes(y, j)"] }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手：把每组等式解到底；对不上或者没有解的，说「失败」。"
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "?P 后面跟着几个变量，解出的函数就有几个参数，次序同 ?P 后面的次序。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "r = repeat(in, body: c1) {",
        "  body {",
        "    c0 = unifier(r.body)",
        "    c1 = uPattern(c0)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "out <- r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
